{"seq":3,"slug":"basic-nursing-skills-and-safety","title":"基础护理操作与病人安全","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-fundamentals/basic-nursing-skills-and-safety","wordCount":1235,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"基础护理操作与病人安全\">基础护理操作与病人安全</h1><p>实习第一周，老师没让我碰任何&quot;高大上&quot;的操作，而是反复盯着我洗手、查对、铺床。我当时有点不服气，后来在病例讨论会上看到一个因为查对失误导致输错液的真实案例，才彻底服气：护理事故绝大多数不是栽在难操作上，而是栽在这些&quot;想当然&quot;的日常环节里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>无菌技术</strong> 是预防医院感染的核心，原则是&quot;无菌物品与非无菌物品分开、无菌区不被跨越污染&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>查对制度</strong> 是给药安全的生命线，经典做法是&quot;三查七对&quot;，现代医院强调用两种身份标识核对病人。</li>\n<li>给药要牢记<strong>给药五正确</strong>：正确的病人、药物、剂量、途径、时间（现扩展为更多&quot;正确&quot;项）。</li>\n<li>病人安全的高发风险是<strong>跌倒、压力性损伤（压疮）、管路滑脱、用药差错</strong>。</li>\n<li>卧位选择直接影响治疗效果与并发症预防，不同病情对应不同体位。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"无菌技术的几条铁律\">无菌技术的几条铁律</h3><p>无菌操作的本质是&quot;管好一个看不见的边界&quot;。手不能跨过无菌区上方、面对无菌盘不能背身、取无菌物品只能用无菌持物钳。一旦怀疑被污染，宁可重来也不要侥幸——因为污染你看不见，但病人会承担后果。手卫生是所有无菌操作的起点，世界卫生组织提出的&quot;手卫生五个时刻&quot;是国内外通用标准。</p>\n<h3 id=\"给药安全-五正确与查对\">给药安全：五正确与查对</h3><p>给药差错往往源于&quot;我以为是对的&quot;。所以查对必须落实到动作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>五正确</th>\n<th>检查动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正确的病人</td>\n<td>用姓名加住院号两种标识核对，不能只喊床号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正确的药物</td>\n<td>看清药名，警惕看似听似的药</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正确的剂量</td>\n<td>复核单位，必要时双人核对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正确的途径</td>\n<td>口服、肌注、静脉不能混</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正确的时间</td>\n<td>按医嘱时间，注意餐前餐后</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>输液速度的计算是病房高频技能。常用公式（普通输液器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> mL</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\ \\text{mL} = 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 滴）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>滴速（滴/分）</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>液体总量（mL）</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mtext>输液总时间（分钟）</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{滴速（滴/分）} = \\frac{\\text{液体总量（mL）} \\times 20}{\\text{输液总时间（分钟）}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">滴速（滴</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">输液总时间（分钟）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">液体总量（</span><span class=\"mord\">mL</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mtext> mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500\\ \\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span> 液体要在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 小时内输完，滴速为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>500</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mn>240</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>≈</mo><mn>42</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dfrac{500 \\times 20}{240} \\approx 42</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">240</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">42</span></span></span></span></span> 滴/分。儿童、心肾功能差的病人要放慢，否则可能诱发心衰或肺水肿。</p>\n<h3 id=\"卧位与并发症预防\">卧位与并发症预防</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[病情] --&gt; B{选择卧位}&#10;    B --&gt; C[休克: 中凹卧位 改善脑供血]&#10;    B --&gt; D[呼吸困难: 半卧位 减轻肺淤血]&#10;    B --&gt; E[腰穿后: 去枕平卧 防头痛]&#10;    B --&gt; F[昏迷无意识: 侧卧位 防误吸]\">flowchart TD\n    A[病情] --&gt; B{选择卧位}\n    B --&gt; C[休克: 中凹卧位 改善脑供血]\n    B --&gt; D[呼吸困难: 半卧位 减轻肺淤血]\n    B --&gt; E[腰穿后: 去枕平卧 防头痛]\n    B --&gt; F[昏迷无意识: 侧卧位 防误吸]</pre><p>体位不只是&quot;让病人舒服&quot;，每种卧位都有明确的生理目的。半卧位让膈肌下降、改善通气，还能让腹腔渗液流向盆腔局限感染，所以腹部术后常用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"病人安全的四个高发风险\">病人安全的四个高发风险</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>跌倒</strong>：评估高危病人（老人、用镇静药、术后虚弱），落实护栏、呼叫器在手边、地面防滑。</li>\n<li><strong>压力性损伤</strong>：长期卧床每 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 小时翻身一次，用 Braden 量表评分预测风险。</li>\n<li><strong>管路滑脱</strong>：妥善固定、做好标识、躁动病人按规范约束。</li>\n<li><strong>用药差错</strong>：靠查对制度和双人核对兜底。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四类风险的共同点是——都可以靠&quot;不偷懒、做到位&quot;来预防。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mtext> mL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\ \\text{mL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mL</span></span></span></span></span></span> 液体要在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 小时输完，用普通输液器算出每分钟滴速。</li>\n<li>一位腹部手术后的病人，应安置什么卧位？说出它的两个生理好处。</li>\n<li>给药时你只核对了床号就发药，可能发生什么后果？正确做法是什么？</li>\n<li>列出预防压力性损伤的三条具体措施，并说明为什么&quot;每 2 小时翻身&quot;是关键。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>用 Braden 量表给一位长期卧床的家人或模拟病例评分，体会评分如何指导护理强度。</li>\n<li>了解世界卫生组织&quot;手卫生五个时刻&quot;，并观察医院走廊里随处可见的洗手提示，理解感控为什么从手开始。</li>\n<li>查阅近年护理不良事件分析报告，你会发现大量事件源于查对和沟通失误，而非技术不足。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>基础护理操作的精髓不在花哨，而在&quot;每次都做到位&quot;。无菌技术守住看不见的边界，给药五正确加查对制度守住用药安全，输液滴速会算才能保证治疗既有效又安全。卧位选择背后都有生理依据，跌倒、压疮、管路、用药四大风险靠扎实的日常习惯来防范。把这些基本功练成本能，你才有底气走进内外科病房。整个第一章到此打好地基，接下来我们进入临床最硬核的内外科护理。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基础护理操作与病人安全","id":"基础护理操作与病人安全"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"无菌技术的几条铁律","id":"无菌技术的几条铁律"},{"level":3,"text":"给药安全：五正确与查对","id":"给药安全-五正确与查对"},{"level":3,"text":"卧位与并发症预防","id":"卧位与并发症预防"},{"level":3,"text":"病人安全的四个高发风险","id":"病人安全的四个高发风险"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生命体征与健康评估","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/nursing-fundamentals/vital-signs-and-health-assessment"},"next":{"title":"内科常见病护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/medical-surgical-nursing/medical-nursing-common-diseases"}}